From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alan Shearer <sakison@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 13:40:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Power: preferences window for battery power saving

Add a Power preferences app with two checkboxes. It writes
/boot/system/settings/power_daemon and asks power_daemon to reload.
It does not change the scheduler mode itself.

Power saving on battery is off unless the user turns it on.
Keep power saving on AC stays in power saving after the adapter is
plugged back in.

